<div class="mandarin-hanzi">雨伞</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">yǔsǎn</div>

''Meaning:'' umbrella  
''Part of speech:'' noun

!! In context
下雨了，别忘了带雨伞。 — Xiàyǔ le, bié wàng le dài yǔsǎn. — It’s raining; don’t forget to bring an umbrella.

!! Usage note
Underlying third-third tones; the first syllable normally undergoes third-tone sandhi in connected speech, while dictionary Pinyin remains yǔsǎn.
